        "original_id": "e5173f34-66cd-5e7b-9df3-c7e8ef117da7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2001 Asian Junior Athletics Championships\n- Organizations: Asian Athletics Association\n- Sports disciplines: 3000 metres steeplechase, athletics, track and field, steeplechase\n- Topics: under-20 competition structure\n\nFacts:\n- The 2001 Asian Junior Athletics Championships was the ninth edition of an international athletics competition for Asian under-20 athletes.\n- The Asian Athletics Association organised the 2001 Asian Junior Athletics Championships.\n- The 2001 Asian Junior Athletics Championships contested 43 events.\n- The 2001 Asian Junior Athletics Championships divided events equally between male and female athletes except for the men's 3000 metres steeplechase.\n- The 3000 metres steeplechase is the most common steeplechase distance in track and field.\n- The 3000 metres steeplechase is an obstacle race run over 3000 metres.\n- The steeplechase derives its name from the horse racing steeplechase.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
